---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Work with Spike | Glenn Edley" description="Get help with Mailchimp and email marketing from Spike, Glenn Edley's email marketing agency.">
  <main class="landing-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">My email marketing agency</p>
    <h1>Work with Spike.</h1>
    <p class="lead">You want to keep in touch with your customers, but planning and sending the emails keeps slipping down the list.</p>
    <p>Spike helps businesses plan, write, build and manage their email marketing. We work with Mailchimp, campaigns and the customer emails that keep things moving between purchases.</p>
    <h2>Start with what you need.</h2>
    <p>Tell me what you're doing now, what you'd like email to do for your business and where you need a hand. We can talk about whether Spike is the right fit.</p>
    <a class="brand-button" href="mailto:glenn@spike.co.nz?subject=Working%20with%20Spike">Email Glenn about Spike <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    <p class="signup-disclosure">This opens your email app. Review and send when you're ready. Email marketing work is provided by Spike; the scope and fee are agreed before work starts.</p>
    <p>Looking for independent advice or a fresh view of the customer journey? <a href="/your-next-move/">Explore working with Glenn.</a></p>
    <p><a href="/articles-and-media/">See how I think about email →</a></p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
